WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.331 --> 00:00:02.026
- I don't know, why
does my mind go to drugs

00:00:02.026 --> 00:00:03.926
immediately with all of these?

00:00:03.926 --> 00:00:05.212
K-pop is a drug.

00:00:05.212 --> 00:00:07.795
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:12.933
I know that K-pop is
loud and wild and fun.

00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:14.939
Occasionally I will turn on the

00:00:14.939 --> 00:00:17.565
K-pop radio station on Spotify.

00:00:17.565 --> 00:00:19.626
- I've watched a couple of Big Bang videos

00:00:19.626 --> 00:00:20.890
in like junior high.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:22.854
- I know it's wildly popular in Korea.

00:00:22.854 --> 00:00:25.479
I've never heard of K-pop slang before.

00:00:25.479 --> 00:00:27.605
So this should be a learning experience.

00:00:27.605 --> 00:00:30.709
- Pretty confident that
I know zero K-pop slang.

00:00:30.709 --> 00:00:32.792
- Well was Gangnam
Style technically K-pop,

00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:34.750
or, that's literally all I know.

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.162
- Bias.

00:00:36.162 --> 00:00:37.384
Um, this is a real word.

00:00:37.384 --> 00:00:39.124
So that's why I'm struggling.

00:00:39.124 --> 00:00:42.004
- Maybe this is like a sick beat

00:00:42.004 --> 00:00:43.507
in K-pop.

00:00:43.507 --> 00:00:46.864
Like, man that bias was so sick.

00:00:46.864 --> 00:00:49.647
- Maybe it's like when you're
listening to a new song

00:00:49.647 --> 00:00:52.478
by a K-pop group, and you
know what kind of music

00:00:52.478 --> 00:00:55.451
they do already, so your bias is like,

00:00:55.451 --> 00:00:57.435
you already know how the music's gonna be.

00:00:57.435 --> 00:00:59.816
- I'm gonna say like, hater?

00:00:59.816 --> 00:01:02.228
If someone's showing bias they could

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.550
not be a fan of something else.

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:05.383
- [Man] Bias.

00:01:05.383 --> 00:01:06.364
Your favorite member of a K-pop group.

00:01:06.364 --> 00:01:07.574
- That makes a lot of sense.

00:01:07.574 --> 00:01:08.536
I mean it does have to do with

00:01:08.536 --> 00:01:10.015
the English definition of bias.

00:01:10.015 --> 00:01:11.408
- That is amazing.

00:01:11.408 --> 00:01:13.955
I will be incorporating that
into my everyday vocabulary.

00:01:13.955 --> 00:01:15.100
- Visual.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.113
Visual probably means like
who's the hottest person

00:01:17.113 --> 00:01:19.107
of the group, I would say.

00:01:19.107 --> 00:01:21.354
- Who's your visual of the group?

00:01:21.354 --> 00:01:22.723
Oh, okay, sure.

00:01:22.723 --> 00:01:24.292
The hottest member of a K-pop group.

00:01:24.292 --> 00:01:27.709
- A visual is when you are swayed to like

00:01:28.731 --> 00:01:33.288
a new song more by the dance
moves in the music video

00:01:33.288 --> 00:01:35.023
than the music itself.

00:01:35.023 --> 00:01:35.952
- Attractive?

00:01:35.952 --> 00:01:36.998
Like hot?

00:01:36.998 --> 00:01:38.800
Blah blah blah is super visual.

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:40.156
- [Man] Visual is the member
who's considered the most

00:01:40.156 --> 00:01:43.070
attractive by the ideal
set of beauty standards.

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:45.041
- Isn't that how most
boy bands and girl groups

00:01:45.041 --> 00:01:46.503
are like put together?

00:01:46.503 --> 00:01:47.907
There's always that one person.

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:49.289
- Hi-touch.

00:01:49.289 --> 00:01:50.435
Oh man.

00:01:50.435 --> 00:01:54.435
A song that spans the
reach of many generations.

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:57.398
- Maybe it's like you wave to somebody,

00:01:57.398 --> 00:01:59.282
and then you give them a hug,

00:01:59.282 --> 00:02:00.748
or someone super super tall

00:02:00.748 --> 00:02:03.541
and you like tap them on the
head, 'cause you're tall.

00:02:03.541 --> 00:02:06.501
- Hi-touch I feel like just
feels like top of the line,

00:02:06.501 --> 00:02:08.898
when like a group member
does something cool,

00:02:08.898 --> 00:02:10.842
you're like, that was so hi-touch!

00:02:10.842 --> 00:02:14.568
- This is when a K-pop band reaches you

00:02:14.568 --> 00:02:17.483
very deep inside of yourself.

00:02:17.483 --> 00:02:19.358
Like you really have a lot of feelings.

00:02:19.358 --> 00:02:23.056
I was hi-touched by (laughs) BTS.

00:02:23.056 --> 00:02:25.355
(cheering)

00:02:25.355 --> 00:02:28.375
- [Man] A fan service where
K-pop idols stand up with

00:02:28.375 --> 00:02:33.194
their hands out and fans line
up to give them a high five.

00:02:33.194 --> 00:02:34.714
- They stand up, they go like this, right?

00:02:34.714 --> 00:02:36.430
And they like, oh yeah, I totally got it.

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:37.535
- Trash.

00:02:37.535 --> 00:02:41.046
Trash is the member of
the K-pop band that's like

00:02:41.046 --> 00:02:43.701
they're just the worst
in every way possible.

00:02:43.701 --> 00:02:45.601
- The not good K-pop bands.

00:02:45.601 --> 00:02:46.563
- Man,

00:02:46.563 --> 00:02:48.063
that song trashed.

00:02:49.049 --> 00:02:50.645
Meaning, it sucked.

00:02:50.645 --> 00:02:52.889
- A song that you secretly like

00:02:52.889 --> 00:02:54.284
that other people hate.

00:02:54.284 --> 00:02:55.517
- When you have an unhealthy obsession

00:02:55.517 --> 00:02:58.614
with a particular group,
and you acknowledge it.

00:02:58.614 --> 00:03:00.621
So like, I'm trashed with BTS?

00:03:00.621 --> 00:03:02.068
- [Group Of Men] Oh yeah!

00:03:02.068 --> 00:03:03.428
- Taylor Swift trash.

00:03:03.428 --> 00:03:05.762
(people cheering)

00:03:05.762 --> 00:03:09.141
- K-pop slang is fun, I
learned so many new words now.

00:03:09.141 --> 00:03:12.597
- It is creative, it knows no bounds,

00:03:12.597 --> 00:03:14.809
and I think I'm gonna start using it.

00:03:14.809 --> 00:03:17.423
- I guess I wasn't expecting real words.

00:03:17.423 --> 00:03:19.420
I don't know what I was expecting.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:22.023
- They're pretty close
to the actual definition,

00:03:22.023 --> 00:03:24.505
I was expecting a lot
more like weird words.

00:03:24.505 --> 00:03:26.085
Hey, you're trash.

00:03:26.085 --> 00:03:30.726
- Hi-touch is actually
just really funny to me.

00:03:30.726 --> 00:03:33.393
(playful music)

